<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Setup • EAFC.Live Control</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/polish.css"></head><body><aside class="sidebar"></aside><main class="content saas-page">
<section class="page-hero compact setup-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">SYSTEM / SETUP</div><h1>Launch readiness</h1><p>One place to verify permissions, core channels, Premium, the economy and member onboarding.</p></div><div class="readiness-score"><strong><%= health.score %>%</strong><span>ready</span></div></section>
<% if(saved){ %><div class="notice">✓ Setup updated</div><% } %><% if(message){ %><div class="notice">✓ <%= message %></div><% } %><% if(error){ %><div class="notice error-notice">⚠ <%= error %></div><% } %>
<section class="setup-layout">
<div class="panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Readiness checks</h2><p><%= health.checks.filter(c=>c.ok).length %> of <%= health.checks.length %> launch checks currently pass.</p></div></div><div class="health-list saas-health-list"><% health.checks.forEach(c=>{ %><a class="health-item <%= c.ok?'good':'bad' %>" href="<%= c.href||'#' %>"><span class="health-icon"><%= c.ok?'✓':'!' %></span><span><strong><%= c.label %></strong><small><%= c.ok?'Configured and healthy':'Needs attention before launch' %></small></span><b><%= c.ok?'Ready':'Fix' %></b></a><% }) %></div></div>
<div class="setup-side">
<section class="panel action-card"><span class="action-icon">⚙</span><div><h2>Quick setup</h2><p>Create any missing core roles, channels and bot connections.</p></div><form method="post" action="/setup/quick" onsubmit="return confirm('Create any missing recommended roles/channels and connect the bot to them?')"><button class="button">Run setup</button></form></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Connection tests</h2><p>Send a harmless test message to each configured destination.</p></div></div><div class="stack-actions"><form method="post" action="/setup/test/welcome"><button class="ghost full" type="submit">Test welcome channel</button></form><form method="post" action="/setup/test/automod"><button class="ghost full" type="submit">Test moderation log</button></form><form method="post" action="/setup/test/tickets"><button class="ghost full" type="submit">Test ticket log</button></form></div></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Member roles</h2><p>Configure self-serve Discord roles and publish the live selector.</p></div></div><div class="actions"><a class="ghost" href="/modules/role_menus">Configure roles</a><form method="post" action="/setup/publish-roles"><button class="button" type="submit">Publish menu</button></form></div></section>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>System areas</h2><p>Jump directly to the controls behind each launch check.</p></div></div><div class="quick-grid"><a class="quick-card" href="/billing"><strong>Premium</strong><span>Stripe plans and Discord access</span></a><a class="quick-card" href="/economy"><strong>Economy</strong><span>XP, coins, quests and rewards</span></a><a class="quick-card" href="/commands"><strong>Commands</strong><span>Access policies</span></a><a class="quick-card" href="/moderation"><strong>Moderation</strong><span>Safety and staff controls</span></a></div></section>
</main></body></html>